  "updated_at": "2026-04-16",
  "bio": "Vitu is a private-tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Juazeiro do Norte, Brazil, where creativity and craftsmanship merge. Specializing in Black & Gray, Fineline, and Floral designs, this intimate studio communicates exclusively through WhatsApp, devoting personal attention to each client from 13:30 to 17:30. Each tattoo at Vitu is a unique work of art, imbuing individuality and personal expression.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Juazeiro Do Norte, Ceara, Brazil"
}